              "type": "text",
              "content": "Abstract.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " We compare four parsing tiers on a small synthetic corpus and report how layout analysis, optical character recognition and formula recognition change throughput and fidelity."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
