            0.909,
            0.425
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "where is the number of pages and , , are fitted constants. In Section 2 we report the measuredn a b c latencies, and we discuss the Hungarian-language test page in Section 3."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
