            0.473,
            0.909,
            0.509
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Each document is parsed once per tier. The median and the 95th percentile of the wall-clock time are recorded for every run, and the results are summarised in Table 1 on the next page."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_footnote",
